  {
    "lesson": "On m-brick-kiln (15k train, 64px, 13 bands, 2 classes), ResNet50 with ssl4eo_s2 weights reached 0.984 in a 2.5-min screen at native 64px, and 0.991 when upsampled to 128px. The 128px run cost 0.175 min/epoch at 40% of the train data, against 0.106 at 64px. Upsampling is worth trying early on small-object Sentinel-2 chips, since kilns are only 10-15 px across.",
    "tags": ["m-brick-kiln", "sentinel-2", "classification", "img_size", "source:tune"]
  },
  {
    "lesson": "On m-brick-kiln at 128px with identical config, ssl4eo_s2 weights scored 0.991 and imagenet weights 0.987 in the 2.5-min screen. The gap is small, but ssl4eo_s2 stays the right default for Sentinel-2. Focal loss tied cross-entropy in the screen (0.991 vs 0.991) and was lower after the longer run (0.989 vs 0.992), so stick with ce for this mildly imbalanced (2:1) binary task. Raising lr from 3e-4 to 1e-3 at 64px gave no gain (0.984 vs 0.984).",
    "tags": ["m-brick-kiln", "sentinel-2", "classification", "weights", "loss", "source:tune"]
  },
  {
    "lesson": "Seed noise on m-brick-kiln validation (999 images) is about ±0.002: three seeds of the same config scored 0.992, 0.988 and 0.989 (mean 0.9897, std 0.0021). The best single seed was the lucky one. Ensembles of 2-3 seeds (0.991, 0.990) and TTA (0.993 single, 0.989 on the 3-model ensemble) all tied within noise. Report the seed mean and skip ensembles and TTA here.",
    "tags": ["m-brick-kiln", "sentinel-2", "classification", "seed-noise", "ensemble", "source:tune"]
  },
  {
    "lesson": "Budget on m-brick-kiln: a 6-config halving round with a 2.5-min screen at train_subset_frac 0.4 and a 6-min rung 2 for the top 2 cost about 24.6 min and ran 14-25 epochs per screen with no warnings. The round already gave 0.992, so a single round plus a 2-seed check (about 10 min) used under half of the 75 min. Cheap screens on a ~15k-image 64px task are enough, and extra rounds are unnecessary when the first one beats the reference.",
    "tags": ["m-brick-kiln", "sentinel-2", "classification", "budget", "source:tune"]
  }
]
